* Kennedy two-op-amp Chua node, values exactly per FSOT-Chua-Circuit BOM (netlist.json).
* Ports: v1 (V_C1 net), v2 (V_C2 net), vcc, vee.  Op-amp subckt chosen by param-free name OPA (see .include order).
* k = time-scale factor (C1, C2, L multiplied by k; all FSOT dimensionless numbers unchanged).
* r0 = inductor series resistance (ohm), gamma = beta*r0/R.
.subckt CHUA_NODE v1 v2 vcc vee params: k=1 r0=0
R   v1 v2 1.8k
C1  v1 0 {10n*k}
C2  v2 0 {100n*k}
L1  v2 nl {22m*k}
Rr0 nl 0 {max(r0,1u)}
* outer NIC branch (U1 = TL082 half A: pin3 +, pin2 -, pin1 out)
XU1 v1 n1m vcc vee o1 OPA
R1  v1  o1  220
R2  o1  n1m 220
R3  n1m 0   2.2k
* inner NIC branch (U2 = TL082 half B: pin5 +, pin6 -, pin7 out)
XU2 v1 n2m vcc vee o2 OPA
R4  v1  o2  22k
R5  o2  n2m 22k
R6  n2m 0   3.3k
.ends CHUA_NODE
